# Copy to .env.local for local development, or add in
# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

# Where contact-form submissions are POSTed as JSON (Resend, Formspree, a
# Zapier hook, an internal mailer…). Optional.
#
# Unset: the form stays on the page but tells visitors to phone dispatch
# instead of pretending to send.
#
# The home and contact pages are statically prerendered and read this at BUILD
# time to decide whether to show the form, so after adding or changing it on
# Vercel, trigger a redeploy.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
